{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Through Rhythm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm is life on the island of Suri.<br>When its harmony is broken, the land twists and turns to a darker pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Ajira</strong>, a young girl who ventures deep into the heart of a musical world gone wrong. Her journey begins as a simple act of hope, to find a rare fruit that could save her mother. But soon it becomes a battle to restore balance to rhythm itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every platform, enemy, and escape sequence moves with the music.<br> Listen closely. Feel the pulse. The beat will guide you\u00a0 or break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rhythm-Driven Action</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, and phase in sync with the soundtrack. The world reacts to your timing, and missing the beat means losing your flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/3f6bdb3af014277666144553f8af332d.poster.avif?t=1762408278\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/3f6bdb3af014277666144553f8af332d.webm?t=1762408278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Cinematic Escape Sequences</strong> \u2013 Push your reflexes through handcrafted chases where gameplay and music fuse into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/d9715cbcebd2f39f7e92a62a66d8c91a.poster.avif?t=1762408278\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/d9715cbcebd2f39f7e92a62a66d8c91a.webm?t=1762408278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Evolving Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock rhythm-infused powers that expand your movement and combat as you learn to master the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/f276582979c04ef104b24732ff9ed1fa.poster.avif?t=1762408278\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/f276582979c04ef104b24732ff9ed1fa.webm?t=1762408278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>A World That Breathes Music</strong> \u2013 From quiet ruins to chaotic arenas, each level is composed like a song \u00a0with its own tempo, tone, and emotion.\u2022 <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Experience a score that blends percussive intensity with melody, shaping how every encounter feels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/71c7abc0b98772258bf5626e9419a670.poster.avif?t=1762408278\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/extras/71c7abc0b98772258bf5626e9419a670.webm?t=1762408278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game That Listens Back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SURI: The Seventh Note, rhythm isn\u2019t decoration \u2014 it\u2019s the law of nature. Learn its patterns. Trust its timing. When you move with the beat, the island moves with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110680?t=1762408278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110680?t=1762408278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/5036314d3a068e829d9f019189bb52afa5e71f35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762408278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110680/5036314d3a068e829d9f019189bb52afa5e71f35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762408278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Through Rhythm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm is life on the island of Suri.<br>When its harmony is broken, the land twists and turns to a darker pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Ajira</strong>, a young girl who ventures deep into the heart of a musical world gone wrong. Her journey begins as a simple act of hope, to find a rare fruit that could save her mother. But soon it becomes a battle to restore balance to rhythm itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every platform, enemy, and escape sequence moves with the music.<br> Listen closely. Feel the pulse. The beat will guide you\u00a0 or break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rhythm-Driven Action</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, and phase in sync with the soundtrack. The world reacts to your timing, and missing the beat means l